Flex Templates	Build status, image version, launch success, and runtime parameters
Airflow	DAG success, task failures, retries, and dependency delays
Bronze	Ingestion completeness, schema changes, and data freshness
Silver	SQL failures, merge results, row counts, and reconciliation
Gold	Business data quality and freshness
CI/CD	Build failures, security findings, approvals, and deployment status
Security	Access denials, policy violations, and privileged actions

Alerts should use agreed thresholds and operational service-level objectives. The Monitoring Agent may diagnose failures and propose corrective changes; production remediation must remain subject to the configured authorization policy.

